# Review: 5e7027602c60014a20e34db0
# Evidence: https://github.com/yeager/translations/blob/28f276ff844b67262c73ea7d582b4540244a440e/Inkscape/inkscape-1.4-sv.po
# Evidence-SHA256: f8208cde93a3edee33dd17d5e657d510239882bc3900660c7059efd8308c940f
# Source-evidence: {}
# Publication: review-commit
#. Review-note (JSON): "Bilingual translation changed in reviewed commit: Archive reviewed Inkscape 1.4 Swedish catalog"
msgctxt "[\"Inkscape\",\"inkscape-1.4-sv.po\",\"\",\"49419\",\"5e7027602c60014a20e34db0\"]"
msgid ""
"\n"
"This function creates path to engrave letters or any shape with sharp angles.\n"
"Cutter's depth as a function of radius is defined by the tool.\n"
"Depth may be any Python expression. For instance:\n"
"\n"
"cone....(45 degrees)......................: w\n"
"cone....(height/diameter=10/3)..: 10*w/3\n"
"sphere..(radius r)...........................: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))\n"
"ellipse.(minor axis r, major 4r).....: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))*4"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"Denna funktion skapar en bana för att gravera bokstäver eller andra former med\n"
"skarpa vinklar. Skärets djup som en funktion av radien definieras av verktyget.\n"
"Djupet kan vara vilket Python-uttryck som helst. Till exempel:\n"
"\n"
"cone....(45 grader)......................: w\n"
"cone....(höjd/diameter=10/3)..: 10*w/3\n"
"sfär..(radie r)...........................: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))\n"
"ellips.(mindre axel r, större 4r).....: math.sqrt(max(0,r**2-w**2))*4"

